{
  "id": "435",
  "title": "What Do You Want To Switch?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-04-28",
  "synopsis": "With all the cheap stuff you can find on Taobao, it's easy to get hooked on shopping.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/608/d5f11d752546d492e1693c3f929fc90908d7da5b.mp3?1513502886",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你想换什么？\n\n     老婆对老公说：“老公，现在淘宝上好多便宜的东西，我准备把手机换了，把电视也换了，还有把去年买的冬天的衣服都换了。老公，你想换什么？”\n     老公说：“我想把老婆换了……”",
    "traditional": "你想換什麼？\n\n     老婆對老公說：“老公，現在淘寶上好多便宜的東西，我準備把手機換了，把電視也換了，還有把去年買的冬天的衣服都換了。老公，你想換什麼？”\n     老公說：“我想把老婆換了……”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n     ",
      "traditional": "\n\n     ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What Do You Want To Switch?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "老婆对老公说：“老公，现在淘宝上好多便宜的东西，",
      "traditional": "老婆對老公說：“老公，現在淘寶上好多便宜的東西，",
      "pinyin": "lǎo po duì lǎo gōng shuō lǎo gōng xiàn zài táo bǎo shang hǎo duō pián yi de dōng xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "我准备把手机换了，把电视也换了，还有把去年买的冬天的衣服都换了。",
      "traditional": "我準備把手機換了，把電視也換了，還有把去年買的冬天的衣服都換了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ zhǔn bèi bǎ shǒu jī huàn le bǎ diàn shì yě huàn le hái yǒu bǎ qù nián mǎi de dōng tiān de yī fu dōu huàn le",
      "english": "The wife said to the husband:  “Darling, nowadays Taobao has a lot of cheap stuff.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "老公，你想换什么？”",
      "traditional": "老公，你想換什麼？”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng nǐ xiǎng huàn shén me",
      "english": "“I'm going to switch mobile phone, switch the TV, and switch all the clothes we bought last winter.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n     ",
      "traditional": "\n     ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Darling, what do you want to switch?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "老公说：“我想把老婆换了……”",
      "traditional": "老公說：“我想把老婆換了……”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo gōng shuō wǒ xiǎng bǎ lǎo po huàn le",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
